{#- B-3 action plan as readable text, so every value has a span to cite.
    Arguments are slot placeholders from b2_narrative.Writer, or lists of them
    already joined. Arguments ending in _n are plain numbers used only to choose
    wording, never printed. The action itself is always the finding's own
    recommended_action, carried verbatim. The literal text holds no digits and
    no number words. A line starting "- " is a bullet. -#}

{% macro heading() -%}
Actions, most urgent first:
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro action(priority, category, severity, text, count, count_n, checkpoints) -%}
- Priority {{ priority }}, {{ category }}, severity {{ severity }}: {{ text }} {{ count }} finding{{ "" if count_n == 1 else "s" }} at {{ checkpoints }}.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro unmapped_heading() -%}
Finding types with no configured action:
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro unmapped(feature, count, count_n, checkpoints) -%}
- No action is configured for finding type {{ feature }}. {{ count }} finding{{ "" if count_n == 1 else "s" }} of this type {{ "was" if count_n == 1 else "were" }} recorded at {{ checkpoints }} and {{ "requires" if count_n == 1 else "require" }} manual review.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro no_recorded_action(feature, count, count_n, checkpoints) -%}
- No recommended action is recorded for finding type {{ feature }}. {{ count }} finding{{ "" if count_n == 1 else "s" }} of this type {{ "was" if count_n == 1 else "were" }} recorded at {{ checkpoints }} and {{ "requires" if count_n == 1 else "require" }} manual review.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro no_findings(run) -%}
No findings were recorded on run {{ run }}; the action plan is empty.
{%- endmacro %}
